# Homegrown binary asset formats (tools/assetpack) - never apply text/CRLF
# transforms. Without this, core.autocrlf can silently corrupt these files on
# checkin (observed: LF byte 0x0A inside raw glyph-metrics data expanded to
# CRLF, inflating a 7676-byte .fontmeta to 10292 bytes).
*.fontatlas binary
*.fontmeta binary
